<title>BELGIUM: Spector H1 1996 pre-tax profit slips.</title>
<headline>Spector H1 1996 pre-tax profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales	  4,057  vs  3,650</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit	  190  vs    228</p>
<p>    Ammortization of goodwill     72  vs     83</p>
<p>    Cons current profit	     32  vs     86</p>
<p>    Cons pre-tax profit	     49  vs     69</p>
<p>    Cash flow			  465  vs    500</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian Spector Photo Group NV is one of Europe's top photo-finishing companies.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom, tel +322 287 6810, fax +322 230 7710</p>
